--- !u!114 &2118726342
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2118726340}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 16332c9658203854893eeda73c08040d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  body: "In this object, sometimes referenced object inside maze loader dissapears.
    So, go to Maze Loader object (child object of this object), then expend \xA8Maze\xA8
    section on Maze Loader script, then you will see two section having object assigned
    to them (or not) which are maze generator and maze settings. for each field you
    need to assign TFMAgentMazeGenerator and   TFMMazeSettings. This way you can
    start using Maze generation.  (RefencesOfLoaderCouldBeMissing_seachTFM)"
